v 3
d center2: fast drop-in replacement for center (Rust plugin)
d
d center2 centers (or standardizes) variables, optionally by group, with the syntax, options,
d results and messages of center by Ben Jann (SSC). It adds by() for grouping unsorted data
d without sorting and threads(). The computation is a compiled Rust plugin (Linux, macOS, Windows).
d
d Author: Leo Liu, auleo.liu@gmail.com
d License: MIT
d Distribution-Date: 20261015
